{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":24,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":24,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af697e8f4429d1fd72f99a1","chatId":"6e61c43fdb144546b7a2dfe1934648aa","sessionId":null,"userId":99999,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"被随口评价一句却惦记好几天，这种滋味挺不好受的，说明你其实很在意别人怎么看自己。那句“又胖了”，最让你卡住的是“胖”这个字，还是那种被人随便打分的感觉？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"被随口评价一句却惦记好几天，这种滋味挺不好受的，说明你其实很在意别人怎么看自己。那句“又胖了”，最让你卡住的是“胖”这个字，还是那种被人随便打分的感觉？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2614,"promptTokens":202,"completionTokens":144,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 12:54:00"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":25,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012426939109966508,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af697e8f4429d1fd72f99a0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794545640009,"createTime":"2026-11-13 12:54:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af697e8f4429d1fd72f99a0","chatId":"6e61c43fdb144546b7a2dfe1934648aa","sessionId":null,"userId":99999,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"就前几天吧，同事随口说我“最近是不是又胖了”，我笑着说没有，回家却一直想。其实我也知道她可能没恶意，但就是……唉。<第12轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012426939109966508,"emot